        "Bidirectional Translation (10 company research Q&A): 'What do you know about our company? (Was wissen Sie über unser Unternehmen?) - I know you specialize in cloud infrastructure and have 500 employees. Why do you want to work for us specifically? (Warum ausgerechnet bei uns?) - Your focus on automation aligns with my skills. What do you know about our products? (Was wissen Sie über unsere Produkte?) - Your main product is a monitoring solution for data centers. What are our company values? (Was sind unsere Unternehmenswerte?) - Innovation, customer focus, and teamwork. Who are our main competitors? (Wer sind unsere Hauptwettbewerber?) - Your main competitors are Company X and Company Y. What recent news about us caught your attention? (Welche aktuellen Neuigkeiten über uns haben Sie gesehen?) - Your new data center in Berlin is impressive. What challenges is our industry facing? (Vor welchen Herausforderungen steht unsere Branche?) - Skills shortage and digital transformation. How do you fit our company culture? (Wie passen Sie zu unserer Unternehmenskultur?) - I am proactive and collaborative. What would you change about our product? (Was würden Sie an unserem Produkt ändern?) - I would improve the user interface. What can you contribute that others cannot? (Was können Sie beitragen, was andere nicht können?) - My combination of self-taught skills and discipline.'",
